= Benefits and aid for the unemployed

There is one protection programme for these recipients. It pays from the month it starts, even under a caretaker cabinet. Each level of scope costs 2 B a month; a benefit does not lower unemployment itself.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @expand
- @focus
- @limit
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@expand
title: Extend the protection
subtitle: Start the protection (2 B a month), or extend it by one level of scope (+2 B), up to 3.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'social_welfare', 'expand').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_social_welfare_expand_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'social_welfare', 'expand');
!}
go-to: result

@focus
title: Focus the aid on the most needy
subtitle: Half of the recipients, the most needy, with the full relief: 1 B instead of 2.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'social_welfare', 'focus').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_social_welfare_focus_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'social_welfare', 'focus');
!}
go-to: result

@limit
title: Limit the benefits
subtitle: A legal change of the benefit: only the difference, e.g. 2 → 1 B. Breaks the guarantee; Lewica +8 dissent.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'social_welfare', 'limit').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_social_welfare_limit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'social_welfare', 'limit');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

